IMPORT prelude

-- Provision index of the Paid Parental Leave Act 2010, compilation C2026C00425.
-- One entry per Chapter, Part, Division, Subdivision and section of the Act's body, with the
-- identifier and the heading as the text prints them, the line of the text file where the
-- heading stands, and a scope flag.
-- The entries are generated by a script that reads the text file; the sections' sub-units
-- (subsections, paragraphs, notes and method-statement steps) are listed for every section in
-- Chapter 2 Parts 2-1 to 2-3 Division 4 and for every section the in-scope text cites.
-- Scope flags: InScope is Chapter 2 Parts 2-1 to 2-3 Division 4; DefinitionsOnly is the Dictionary,
-- in scope for the terms the in-scope text uses; OutOfScope is everything else.

DECLARE `Kind of provision` IS ONE OF PChapter, PPart, PDivision, PSubdivision, PSection

DECLARE `Scope of a provision` IS ONE OF InScope, OutOfScope, DefinitionsOnly

DECLARE Provision HAS
    identifier IS A STRING
    heading IS A STRING
    kind IS A `Kind of provision`
    scope IS A `Scope of a provision`
    line IS A NUMBER
    units IS A LIST OF STRING

-- ruler:               identifier, heading, kind, scope, line of the text file, sub-units printed
@ref Headings of the Chapters, Parts, Divisions, Subdivisions and sections as the text prints them
`the provision index` MEANS
