GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE Provision
`the index entry for` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN p YIELD p's identifier EQUALS identifier) `the provision index`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN p FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST p

GIVEN identifier IS A STRING, unit IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the index prints the unit` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the index entry for` identifier
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST p THEN elem unit (p's units)

GIVEN scope IS A `Scope of a provision`
GIVETH A STRING
`the words for a scope flag` MEANS
    CONSIDER scope
    WHEN InScope THEN "in scope"
    WHEN OutOfScope THEN "out of scope"
    WHEN DefinitionsOnly THEN "in scope for the defined terms the in-scope text uses"
